  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.19: layout super/subscript and PDF symbol-fallback fixes. #71: the layout/Avalonia live preview gains SuperscriptRun/SubscriptRun and now renders ^sup^, ~sub~, and footnote markers as smaller, baseline-shifted text (footnote markers as clickable superscript links) instead of plain inline text. #72: the PDF symbol font-fallback now iterates Unicode codepoints, so non-BMP characters no longer become '??' (one missing-glyph indicator at worst), and a footnote in a table cell no longer disables symbol fallback for the rest of the cell. See CHANGELOG.md.",
